<title>UK: SBC SETS CALL WARRANTS ON AT &amp; T.</title>
<headline>SBC SETS CALL WARRANTS ON AT &amp; T.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 30 million European-style call warrants on shares of AT&amp;T Corp, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $40.0		     PREMIUM	11.53 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $0.99		     GEARING	6.43 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   21.AUG.98		 PAYDATE	18.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 10</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $41.6734</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
